OL,5,G2245 Mr Sidhu's Post Office by Amman
OL,6,G     Brar
OL,7,     F1/10. It is 2007, and Mr Sidhu is
OL,8,     Fthe sub-postmaster of a local post
OL,9,     Foffice in Richmond upon Thames,
OL,10,     Fbut his world is about to be
OL,11,     Fshifted on its axis.
OL,12,G2300 Intimacy
OL,13,     F4/4. With tensions at breaking
OL,14,     Fpoint, Liza confronts the past and
OL,15,     Ffaces serious consequences. Called
OL,16,     Finto an urgent meeting, her future
OL,17,     Fon the film hangs in the balance.
